              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nana6"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We love this soup! I used 4 cups chicken broth &amp; 3 cups water. I like to use chicken broth in most soups when it calls for water. I like to cut my potatoes kind of chunky so used 3 cups. It’s even better the second day!",
