            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "nikki"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a great recipe. After reading other reviews, I halved the recipe and it still made a big pot. I also doubled the potatoes, used broth instead of water, added 1 cup of chopped carrots, and 2 cups of pulled, cooked chicken. I also added salt and pepper to taste. My husband and I thought it was really good. My 2 year old liked it, too. I will definitely make this again. Thanks for posting.",
            "datePublished": "2009-04-27T18:25:07.927Z"
          },
