              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "rebekah"
            },
            "reviewBody": "i only gave 4 stars because i made some changes, but i'm sure if i'd followed it exactly it would have been great too! i cut the recipe in half for starters, but because of the runny comment, i only used about 3/4 of a qt and used vegetable broth instead of water. i also used cream of celery instead of cream of chicken, and i omitted the cheese because i didn't have any on hand. It came out Wonderful! it was exactly the creamy vegetable soup i was looking for! with the changes, a great vegetarian soup! thanks",
